'''Screech''' is a [[debuff]] that reduces [[movement speed]] by 20% per stack. This skill is used by most [[sea witch]]es. This debuff has a duration of 2 seconds, and can stack up to 10 times.

==Trivia==
The graphic status icon of Screech was recycled and re-used as [[The Vaal Omnitect]]'s version of "Lightning Exposure" debuff. The debuff was renamed into "Omnitect's Paralysis" in [[version 3.17.3b]], as the effect of that debuff is somewhat similar to Screech but not similar to the real [[Exposure]] debuff.
